    "url": "https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2124980590717911527",
    "username": "OpenAI",
    "text": "We’re introducing Shirudo, an open-source Linux runtime allowing agents to defend systems without downtime. It lets agents write dynamic eBPF controls to shield systems from exploits, giving defenders more time to test and roll out patches. Built by @cisco together with OpenAI.\n\nShirudo is a first step toward self-defending infrastructure that can adapt to new threats while keeping services running. Our goal is for defenders to work with AI agents to find affected systems, test and share shields",
    "text_ja": null
